sequenceDiagram
    actor Agent
    participant LWC as successionContactCadence (LWC)
    participant Task
    participant Flow as Task_Create_Next_Contact_Attempt (Flow)

    Agent->>LWC: Complete Task (Day N)
    LWC->>Task: Update Status = Completed
    Task-->>Flow: After Update (decision gates)
    activate Flow
    Flow->>Task: Create next Task (Day N + offset)
    Flow-->>LWC: Unlock next step
    deactivate Flow

    Note right of LWC: Sequential unlock pattern\n- Next step blocked until prior completed\n- Stops when Contact_Established__c = true

